### Install the "REST Client" extension, then click "Send Request" above any request.
### Change @base / @key to your server and key.
@base = http://localhost:3000
@key = your-api-key

### 1. Is the server alive? (no key needed)
GET {{base}}/health

### 2. Analyze a few points (tiny example - use real data from your app for real results)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/farming/analyze
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{key}}

{
  "points": [
    {"latitude": 18.1447, "longitude": 74.8853, "timeStamp": "2026-11-02 11:02:35", "speed": 6},
    {"latitude": 18.1450, "longitude": 74.8851, "timeStamp": "2026-11-02 11:03:20", "speed": 6}
  ],
  "date": "2026-11-02"
}

### 3. Analyze a device straight from the database (usp_history_replay)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/farming/analyze
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{key}}

{
  "deviceId": 1555,
  "fromDate": "2026-10-12 00:00:00",
  "toDate": "2026-10-12 23:00:00",
  "farmingPercent": 0,
  "date": "2026-10-12",
  "mode": "auto",
  "includePath": true
}

### 4. Wrong key -> 401
POST {{base}}/api/v1/farming/analyze
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: wrong

{"points": []}
